                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.29784/2610.29784v1/deepevolve_overview.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview ofDeepEvolvefor recursive self-improvement in real-world event forecasting.a,The closed loop connects question generation, forecasting, and evolution, with resolved outcomes supplying verifiable rewards and updates feeding into subsequent rounds.b,Prometheusgenerates questions through templates and agent-driven discovery, followed by temporal validation, deduplication, conflict detection, and diversity-aware selection.c,Branchusseparates evidence gathering, by asearch teamof a scheduler, searcher, and critic, from probabilistic prediction, by apredict team. The search team is time-sensitive, as its result depends on when it runs, while the predict team is time-invariant, reasoning only over the search team’s cached evidence and reasoning trajectories. Both teams retrieve relevant forecasting skills.d,Athenaupdates the predict team’s parameters using cached evidence and verifiable rewards, distills search trajectories into reusable forecasting skills, and converts observed weaknesses into task-synthesis skills forPrometheus. Resolved outcomes inform parameter and environment updates but are withheld from the behavior-level judge.",
                "position": 365
            }
        ]
